{"product":{"id":8476531196243,"title":"SYSTEM 4 MILD SHAMPOO 3","body_html":"\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eMILD SHAMPOO 3 BY SYSTEM 4\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003eTherapeutic shampoo for the well-being of the scalp\u003cstrong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003eSpecial, mild shampoo for everyday use. Prevents dandruff. Soothes itching, keeps the scalp and hair in good condition. Washes effectively but gently, leaving hair clean and shiny. To maintain the results achieved on the scalp, we also recommend using Mild Shampoo as an aftercare. Contains salicylic acid, which acts as an exfoliating ingredient. Climbazole prevents dandruff. Product is not suitable for children under 3 years of age.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eBENEFITS:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eGentle and gentle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eTo maintain the results achieved\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eSoothes itchy scalp\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eRemoves dandruff and prevents it from forming\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eParfume free and dermatologically tested\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThe bottle is made of 100% recycled plastic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUSAGE:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eApply shampoo thoroughly to hair \u0026amp; scalp. Leave on for 2-5 minutes and rinse. Longer exposure time than regular shampoo.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003epH 4.7\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Rempire Tower Shop","product_type":"Shampoo","created_at":"2023-07-19T18:21:13+03:00","handle":"system-4-mild-shampoo-3","updated_at":"2026-09-02T13:03:30+03:00","published_at":"202